* BZX55C5V1 nominal ngspice model
* Pin order: A K
*
* Nominal values:
* Vz  = 5.1 V at Izt = 5 mA
* Rs  = 6 ohm
* Cjo = 178 pF

.subckt BZX5V1 A K params:
+ Vz=5.1 Izt=5m Rsbr=6 Nbr=1
+ Ir=0.1u Cjo=178p Tcv=0

* Calibrate terminal voltage to Vz at Izt
.param Bvbr={Vz-Izt*Rsbr}

Dbr INT K ZBR
Df  A   K ZFWD
Abl INT A ZBLOCK

* Reverse breakdown characteristic
.model ZBR D (
+ IS={Ir/10} N={Nbr} RS={Rsbr}
+ BV={Bvbr} IBV={Izt}
+ EG=1.11 XTI=3 M=0.33
+ TNOM=25 TBV1={Tcv}
+ )

* Forward characteristic
.model ZFWD D (
+ IS=1p RS=3.5 N=1.4
+ CJO={Cjo} VJ=0.61 M=0.335 FC=0.7
+ XTI=3 EG=1.186
+ )

* Near-ideal internal blocking diode
.model ZBLOCK sidiode (
+ RON=0.1m ROFF=1T VFWD=0 EPSILON=1u
+ )

.ends BZX5V1
